      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Coming soon to Oldtown Woods, Celbridge, these beautifully designed two bedroom homes by O’Flynn Group offer an exceptional opportunity to secure a premium new home in one of the area’s most sought-after residential developments. Ideally positioned off Shackleton Road, Oldtown Woods combines a peaceful, landscaped setting with superb convenience to Celbridge village, local schools, amenities and excellent transport links.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nFeaturing stylish interiors, beautifully appointed kitchens and bathrooms, generous private gardens and an impressive A2 energy rating, these homes are ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and those seeking quality and comfort in an established community.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSelling agents Lisney Sotheby’s International Realty and Coonan Property invite interested purchasers to register now for further information on this forthcoming release."
